       story:'Parashara was the grandson of Vashistha and the father of Vyasa (born of Satyavati on a river island). He wrote the Brihat Parashara Hora Shastra — the foundational text of Vedic astrology (Jyotish), still the primary reference for all subsequent astrologers. He also wrote the Parashara Smriti and transmitted large portions of the Vishnu Purana.',
