//  ERA 13: NARASIṂHA — Half-Man, Half-Lion · The Threshold
//  References: Bhāgavata Purāṇa 7.2–10 · Viṣṇu Purāṇa · Narasiṃha
//  Tāpanīya Upaniṣad · Adi Śaṅkara on threshold-states · synthesis
//  by Rahul S.
