// Bhagavad Gītā · Chapter 11 · 55 verses · the eleventh of eighteen chapters
//
// Eleven acts. Eleven · the chapter number, the number of Rudras, and the
// number of the unmoved breath itself. Each act is a moment from the verse.
//
// Architecture: unique `vp` prefix (was `vr` which collided with Virāṭ — the
// bug the user reported). One IIFE. No global pollution.
//
// Synthesis & narrative: Rahul S.
// Reference: Bhagavad Gītā 11.1–55 · Mahābhārata Bhīṣma Parva
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

